1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:01,290
You've heard this.

2
00:00:01,830 --> 00:00:04,658
that Hanuman swallowed the sun in his childhood.

3
00:00:04,658 --> 00:00:07,132
But is this true? In the Valmiki Ramayana,

4
00:00:07,132 --> 00:00:08,840
this tale is a bit different.

5
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:12,370
Anjana went to the forest for fruit.

6
00:00:12,910 --> 00:00:15,039
and the hungry child began to cry.

7
00:00:15,039 --> 00:00:16,730
Then he saw the rising sun.

8
00:00:17,680 --> 00:00:19,005
Red like a hibiscus,

9
00:00:19,005 --> 00:00:21,060
he thought it was a ripe fruit,

10
00:00:21,860 --> 00:00:24,560
and he leaped... straight up into the sky,

11
00:00:24,560 --> 00:00:25,910
thousands of yojanas.

12
00:00:26,790 --> 00:00:28,859
Surya Dev saw him, thinking,

13
00:00:28,859 --> 00:00:31,740
he is a child, and he did not burn him.

14
00:00:34,210 --> 00:00:36,694
That day, Rahu tried to swallow the sun,

15
00:00:36,694 --> 00:00:37,750
but fled in fear.

16
00:00:37,850 --> 00:00:39,657
and complained to Indra.

17
00:00:39,657 --> 00:00:41,990
Indra hurled his vajra. The boy

18
00:00:44,130 --> 00:00:46,966
fell on a mountain and his left jaw was broken.

19
00:00:46,966 --> 00:00:49,138
Hanuman couldn't swallow... the sun,

20
00:00:49,138 --> 00:00:50,647
but what happened next...

21
00:00:50,647 --> 00:00:52,940
was far more than just a meal for him.

22
00:00:53,040 --> 00:00:54,667
Seeing his son lifeless,

23
00:00:54,667 --> 00:00:56,430
Pavan Dev stopped blowing,

24
00:00:57,100 --> 00:00:59,740
and the breath of all three worlds stopped.

25
00:00:59,740 --> 00:01:03,240
Then Brahma touched the boy and brought him back to life.

26
00:01:03,580 --> 00:01:05,794
His jaw was broken by my vajra,

27
00:01:05,794 --> 00:01:08,793
therefore this boy will be called Hanuman,

28
00:01:08,793 --> 00:01:09,650
and my vajra

29
00:01:10,360 --> 00:01:12,168
will never hurt him again.

30
00:01:12,168 --> 00:01:14,740
Then Surya Dev bestowed his radiance.

31
00:01:15,550 --> 00:01:17,655
And Yama, Varuna, Kuber,

32
00:01:17,655 --> 00:01:20,550
and Brahma himself granted boons,

33
00:01:20,550 --> 00:01:22,830
that no weapon, no disease

34
00:01:23,210 --> 00:01:24,240
could ever touch him.

35
00:01:25,280 --> 00:01:27,055
The blow that brought him down,

36
00:01:27,055 --> 00:01:29,460
gave him his name, and boundless strength.

37
00:01:31,050 --> 00:01:33,107
Yet even with such strength,

38
00:01:33,107 --> 00:01:35,017
how did Hanuman forget it?

39
00:01:35,017 --> 00:01:36,340
In the next story.

